working_notes/lemma_bank.md:303:Statement: Under these assumptions the attainable reward set \(C\subset[0,T]^\Theta\) is product compact. Hence \(\mathcal R_G(\Theta)=\Phi_G(\Theta)\), and finite-subclass Bayes-gap values characterize the full grid minimax value.
